                "snippet": "Return and Refund Policy\n1. Purpose and scope\n2. Return windows and restocking fees\nThe table below applies to purchases made in stores and on Lumen.com. A restocking fee is a percentage of the price the customer paid for the item after discounts, and it is deducted from the refund. Fees are charged only on items returned opened or used and never on defective or damaged items.\nElectronics, Return window = 30 days. Electronics, Unopened or unused = No fee. Electronics, Opened or used (not defective) = 15% restocking fee. Electronics, Defective or damaged = No fee. Electronics,  = . Furniture, Return window = 45 days. Furniture, Unopened or unused = No fee. Furniture, Opened or used (not defective) = 20% restocking fee. Furniture, Defective or damaged = No fee; free pickup. Furniture,  = . Home Decor, Return window = 60 days. Home Decor, Unopened or unused = No fee. Home Decor, Opened or used (not defective) = No fee. Home Decor, Defective or damaged = No fee. Home Decor,  = . Kitchen, Return window = Dining. Kitchen, Unopened or unused = 60 days. Kitchen, Opened or used (not defective) = No fee. Kitchen, Defective or damaged = 10% restocking fee on small appliances; no fee on other items. Kitchen,  = No fee. Bedding, Return window = Bath. Bedding, Unopened or unused = 45 days. Bedding, Opened or used (not defective) = No fee. Bedding, Defective or damaged = 10% restocking fee. Bedding,  = No fee. Apparel, Return window = 90 days. Apparel, Unopened or unused = No fee. Apparel, ",
