                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Return and Refund Policy\n1. Purpose and scope\n2. Return windows and restocking fees\n- Small appliances in Kitchen & Dining are air fryers, stand mixers, coffee makers, electric kettles, countertop • blenders and toasters. Cookware, knives, dinnerware, glassware, storage and flatware carry no fee.\n- Electronics are the only category that also requires the serial number to be captured at the return. •\n- Items marked Final Sale (including clearance priced at 70 percent off or more), gift cards and personalized • items cannot be returned unless defective.\nPOL-RET-014 | Version 4.2 Internal use only. Synthetic document for a software demonstration. Page 1 of 3\nLUMEN RETAIL GROUP Return and Refund Policy",
