                "title": "return-refund-policy.pdf",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Return and Refund Policy\n5. Online orders and mail returns\nItems bought on Lumen.com can be returned in any Lumen store under the same window and fee rules (buy online, return in store), or by mail.\n- (\\bullet) Mail returns use the prepaid label in the order confirmation. A $7.95 label fee is deducted from the refund unless the item is defective, damaged in transit, or the wrong item was sent.\n- (\\bullet) Furniture pickup. Furniture that is not defective is collected by the carrier for a $79 pickup fee, deducted from the refund. Pickup is free for defective or damaged furniture.\n- (\\bullet) Holiday extension. Purchases made between November 1 and December 24 may be returned until January 31 of the following year. Electronics purchased in that period may be returned until January 15.\nPOL-RET-014 | Version 4.2 Internal use only. Synthetic document for a software demonstration. Page 2 of 3\nLUMEN RETAIL GROUP Return and Refund Policy",
                "metadata": {
