                "title": "return-refund-policy.pdf",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Return and Refund Policy\n3. General conditions\n- (\\bullet) Proof of purchase. A return is matched to an order by receipt, order number, or the customer’s Lumen Rewards ID. A customer who has none of these is handled under the no-receipt rules in the Asset Protection memo in force.\n- (\\bullet) Return window. The window in section 2 runs from the purchase date in store, or the delivery date for online and delivered orders. Lumen Rewards Gold members receive 15 extra days on every window.\n- (\\bullet) Condition. An item is unopened or unused when its packaging is sealed and it shows no sign of use. It is opened or used when the packaging has been opened or the item has been assembled, worn, washed or plugged in. It is defective or damaged when it does not work as described or arrived damaged; the cashier records the condition code at the point of sale (see the Store Operations SOP).\n- (\\bullet) Original packaging. Electronics and small appliances must come back with all accessories and the original packaging. Missing accessories are deducted from the refund at replacement cost.\n- (\\bullet) Same item exchanges are never charged a restocking fee.",
                "metadata": {
